<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/14th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Näfels</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1388</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Näfels was fought on 9 April 1388 in the canton of Glarus, where the men of Glarus, with help from Schwyz, defeated a much larger <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/habsburg-dynasty">Habsburg</a> army. Following the Swiss victory at Sempach in 1386, it secured the independence of Glarus from Habsburg rule. It is commemorated every April by the Näfelser Fahrt procession.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-nafels.jpg" alt="Battle of Näfels" width="320" height="339" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Diebold Schilling der Jüngere · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Diebold_Schilling_Chronik_Folio_18r_45.tif" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
